<diagram program="umletino" version="15.1"><zoom_level>10</zoom_level><element><id>UMLSequenceAllInOne</id><coordinates><x>0</x><y>0</y><w>6520</w><h>1720</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>title=SD06 — Savings Goal Planning and Replanning (UC08, F09)
obj=User~User ACTOR
obj=GoalsView~GV
obj=DashboardView~DV
obj=WealthSeiFacade~F
obj=GoalService~GS
obj=AlertMonitor~AM
obj=GoalPlanner~GP
obj=ForecastEngine~FE
obj=PlanRepository~PLR
obj=AgentController~AC
obj=ToolManager~TM
obj=GoalTool~GT
obj=ProposalService~PS
obj=CommandFactory~CF
obj=ProposalRepository~PR
obj=Proposal~P CREATED_LATER

User: Part A - after every import, goals are re-evaluated
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS: evaluateAll()
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS +1: evaluate(goal)
combinedFragment=opt~cf0 DV AM; DV: [a goal is AT_RISK or BEHIND]
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AM: publish(alert)
AM-&gt;&gt;&gt;DV: onAlert(alert)
DV.&gt;User: goal-at-risk alert with a Replan button
--=cf0
GS.&gt;F: List of SavingsGoal
User: Part B - plan a goal (Replan re-enters the flow here)
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;GV: fill goal form, click Plan
GV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: planGoal(request)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS: createGoal(request)
combinedFragment=alt~cf1 User P; User: [deadline in the past or target not positive]
GS.&gt;F: throw ValidationException
F.&gt;GV: error message
..=cf1; User: [goal valid]
GS.&gt;F: SavingsGoal
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC: handle(AgentTask GOAL_PLAN)
combinedFragment=loop~cf2 GS GT; GS: [agent loop (see SD05)]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM: execute(toolCall GoalTool)
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;GT: run(args)
GT-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS: feasibility(goal)
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GP: requiredMonthly(goal, today)
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PLR: find()
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;FE: monthlySurplus(inputs)
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GP: buildOptions(goal, surplus)
GS.&gt;GT: FeasibilityReport
GT.&gt;TM: ToolResult
TM.&gt;AC: ToolResult
--=cf2
AC.&gt;F: AgentResult (plan text, ProposalDrafts)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS: createFromDrafts(drafts, traceId)
combinedFragment=loop~cf3 PS P; PS: [each draft]
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS +1: passesGuardrails(draft)
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;CF: create(draft)
CF.&gt;PS: Command
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;P: new Proposal(draft, command, new PendingState())
PS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PR: save(proposal)
--=cf3
PS.&gt;F: List of Proposal
F.&gt;GV: goal, plan, proposals
GV.&gt;User: plan and pending proposals
--=cf1
User: Replan: onReplan(goalId) calls replanGoal(goalId) which enters the flow at AgentController.handle()</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element></diagram>